clueweb09-en0007-85-36499.125 Dutchess County Tourism complemented by year-round outdoor activities, wineries, historical attractions and fun for the entire family. Enjoy spectacular views of the Hudson River and Catskill Mountains – you’ll get more than you expect in Dutchess County! SERVICES PROVIDED BY DUTCHESS COUNTY TOURISM OFFICE & STAFF “WHAT IF YOU GET MORE THAN YOU EXPECT?” This is our motto in Dutchess County and that of our meeting and conference facilities located here. At Dutchess County Tourism the staff is ready and eager to help you with planning a successful event. They are very knowledgeable about the county and additional services you may need. From the planning stage through the completion of the event, we want to make your event the best ever. Send us your requirements. We will see that they get to the facilities that will tailor a proposal just for you. Provide alternative and creative meeting locations in historic buildings and public
